        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Cadillac insurance plan\n- Projects: Clinton health care plan of 1993\n- People: Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton\n- Places: United States\n\nFacts:\n- The Clinton health care plan of 1993 was a healthcare reform package proposed in 1993 by the administration of President Bill Clinton.\n- Hillary Clinton, as First Lady of the United States, was closely associated with the task force that devised the Clinton health care plan of 1993.\n- A Cadillac insurance plan is an informal term in the United States for any unusually expensive health insurance plan.\n- Discussions of medical-cost control measures in the United States usually use the term Cadillac plan for unusually expensive health insurance plans.",
